The `Web3Provider` component (`frontend/components/web3/Web3Provider.tsx`) uses React Context (`useWeb3` hook) to manage wallet connection (MetaMask), account details, and network status (checking for Sepolia). 

Core Web3 utilities (getting provider, accounts, network details, switching network) are in `frontend/lib/web3/web3.ts`. 

Contracts are loaded dynamically via `frontend/lib/web3/contracts.ts` using JSON artifacts from `frontend/contracts/`. The `Web3Provider` wraps the main application layout (`frontend/app/layout.tsx`).
